@startuml
title Bunny Code - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Visitor
actor "Authenticated User" as AuthUser
actor "Project Owner/Collaborator" as Owner
actor "Battle Participant" as Battler
actor Maintainer

node "Browser (Vue App)" as Browser

node "Nginx Reverse Proxy" as Nginx

node "Backend (Node.js/Express + Socket.IO)" as Backend {
  component "Auth API / JWT" as AuthAPI
  component "Project API" as ProjectAPI
  component "Version API / Init Files" as VersionAPI
  component "Workspace Socket API" as WorkspaceSock
  component "Battle Socket API" as BattleSock
  component "Code Execution API" as ExecAPI
  component "Playback API" as PlaybackAPI
  component "File Upload API" as FileUploadAPI
}

database "MySQL\n(users, projects, versions, battles)" as MySQL
database "InfluxDB\n(coding-process records)" as InfluxDB
rectangle "Redis\n(cache, workspace mapping,\nbattle invitations/state)" as Redis
node "Docker Sandbox\n(code compile/execute)" as Sandbox
cloud "Object Storage (S3-compatible)" as S3
cloud "CDN Distribution\n(CloudFront-style)" as CDN

Visitor --> Browser
AuthUser --> Browser
Owner --> Browser
Battler --> Browser
Maintainer --> Nginx

Browser --> Nginx : HTTP + WebSocket
Nginx --> Backend : REST + Socket.IO
Browser --> CDN : Static assets & archives

Backend --> MySQL
Backend --> InfluxDB
Backend --> Redis
Backend --> Sandbox
Backend --> S3
S3 --> CDN

Browser --> AuthAPI : register/login + JWT
Browser --> ProjectAPI : project CRUD
Browser --> VersionAPI : version create + init files
Browser ..> WorkspaceSock : socket: authorization, status, edit, leave, cleanup
Browser ..> BattleSock : socket: invite, accept, readiness, sync, judge, outcome
Browser --> ExecAPI : compile/execute code
Browser --> PlaybackAPI : playback query
Browser --> FileUploadAPI : upload files

AuthAPI --> MySQL
ProjectAPI --> MySQL
VersionAPI --> MySQL
WorkspaceSock --> Redis : socket<->version mapping when authorized
BattleSock --> Redis : invitation read-delete (watched)
PlaybackAPI --> InfluxDB
ExecAPI --> Sandbox
FileUploadAPI --> S3

note right of WorkspaceSock
Defaults: readOnly=true, authorization=false when
missing project or version identifiers.
Writes Redis socket/version mapping only when
access is authorized and Redis is ready.
end note

note right of BattleSock
Acceptance uses Redis isolated execution and watched
state; upon reading a temporary invitation, delete it
to prevent repeated acceptance under concurrency.
end note

note right of ExecAPI
Code execution isolates in Docker sandbox, not inside
main backend process.
end note

note right of AuthAPI
Validate JWT bearer tokens; reject empty or malformed
tokens with API error; resolve user info object when valid.
end note

note bottom of S3
Store code files, battle result files, user files,
static assets, and archives; return distributable URLs.
end note

note bottom of CDN
Distribute assets/archives via configured URLs.
end note

note bottom of Redis
Verify readiness before cache-dependent operations;
deployment provides host/port/credentials. Persistence
options are deployment choices.
end note

@enduml